        "id": 1000014
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-25T23:47:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This part doesn\u0027t seem necessary, and usually we avoid implicit conversions. In this particular case it could make it easier to accidentally leave yourself holding only a `T*` when you really need a `Ref\u003cT\u003e` (in case another ref is dropped meanwhile).",
      "revId": "c707a19fcdb1738645c66c819636d48c04ff88da",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
